{
    "info": {
        "name": "M42 - Feature Flags + Maintenance Windows + Training Mode",
        "description": "Canonical M42 collection. Covers feature flags, maintenance windows (incl. BLOCK_WRITES enforcement against the inventory write surface), training sessions (with x-training-session-id header short-circuit), and the flag-audit trail. Mirrors AI_POSTMAN_WORKING_PATTERNS R1-R20 (canonical pre-request, dual-scope variable writes, [STANDALONE] folder labels, R17 list-first auto-resolution).\n\nLocked rules verified here:\n- POST /flags writes a FLAG_CREATED audit row.\n- PATCH /flags/:key with status DISABLED writes a FLAG_DISABLED audit row.\n- ACTIVE BLOCK_WRITES INVENTORY_WRITES window blocks POST /inventory/adjustments with 409.\n- Training mode short-circuits POST /inventory/adjustments via x-training-session-id; no real StockAdjustment row is persisted.\n- chef@demo.local cannot read or write flags (403).\n\nRE-IMPORT REQUIRED after any script change (R8).",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
