                        "description": "Run folders in order:\nA. Auth & Context [STANDALONE]\nB. Feature Flags [STANDALONE] - list seeded flags, create + update one (writes audit).\nC. Maintenance Windows [STANDALONE] - create SCHEDULED BLOCK_WRITES window, activate, prove inventory write blocked (409), then COMPLETED.\nD. Training Sessions [STANDALONE] - start one, second start for same actor returns 403.\nE. Guarded Write Examples [STANDALONE] - same inventory POST short-circuits when x-training-session-id is sent.\nF. Flag Audit [STANDALONE] - list audit entries.\n\nLocked decisions verified:\n- ACTIVE BLOCK_WRITES INVENTORY_WRITES window -> POST /inventory/adjustments returns 409.\n- x-training-session-id header -> simulated response, no real row.\n- chef@demo.local cannot read or write flags (403)."
                    }
                }
            ]
